              </div>
              <h3 class="font-sans font-black text-xl sm:text-2xl mb-4 tracking-tight">
                <span class="headline-bubble-sm">I show up to your spot.</span>
              </h3>
              <p class="text-bay-ink text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-semibold">
                I work with what your driveway has — your hose, your power, your shade. We figure out the setup together when I arrive, and the job gets done.
              </p>
            </li>
            <li class="text-center">
              <div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-5 rounded-full bg-bay-gold/25 flex items-center justify-center font-sans font-black text-bay-ink text-3xl">
                3
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-sans font-black text-xl sm:text-2xl mb-4 tracking-tight">
                <span class="headline-bubble-sm">Pay when it's done.</span>
              </h3>
              <p class="text-bay-ink text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-semibold">
                I walk you around the car. If you're not happy, I make it right. Card, cash, or Zelle.
              </p>
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ── BOOKING FORM ───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
      <section id="book" class="paper-depth-dark py-20 sm:py-28 relative overflow-hidden">
        <!-- gold corner accent for depth -->
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-72 h-72 rounded-full bg-bay-gold/8 blur-3xl pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div>

        <div class="container mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 sm:px-8 relative">
          <div class="text-center mb-10">
            <p class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-bay-gold text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] mb-3">
              <span class="inline-block w-4 h-0.5 bg-bay-gold"></span>
              Book in 60 seconds
              <span class="inline-block w-4 h-0.5 bg-bay-gold"></span>
            </p>
            <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-4xl sm:text-5xl mb-6 leading-[1.2] tracking-tight">
              <span class="headline-bubble-dark">Tell me about your car.</span>
            </h2>
            <p class="text-white text-lg max-w-xl mx-auto font-semibold">
              I'll call you back within 2 hours with the exact price and the next available slot.
            </p>
          </div>

          <LovebugQuickBook client:load />
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ── FAQ ────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
      <section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-white border-t border-bay-ink/8">
        <div class="container mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 sm:px-8">
          <p class="label-strong text-sm mb-4 text-center">
            <span class="inline-block">Quick questions, answered</span>
          </p>
          <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-bay-ink mb-10 text-center tracking-tight">
            Stuff people ask before they call.
          </h2>
          <dl class="space-y-5">
            {faqs.map((item) => (
              <details class="group bg-white border border-bay-ink/10 rounded-2xl px-6 py-5 shadow-[0_8px_24px_-18px_rgba(15,27,45,0.3)]">
                <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none flex items-start justify-between gap-4 text-bay-ink font-sans font-black text-lg sm:text-xl tracking-tight">
                  <span>{item.q}</span>
                  <span class="flex-shrink-0 text-bay-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-3xl leading-none font-light" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
                </summary>
                <p class="text-bay-ink text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mt-4 font-semibold">
